@gateway = http://localhost:4004
# Paste a token from POST /auth/login here:
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### Get all patients (JWT-protected)
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a patient
POST {{gateway}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace Hopper",
  "email": "grace.hopper@example.com",
  "address": "1 Navy Yard",
  "dateOfBirth": "1906-12-09",
  "registeredDate": "2025-01-01"
}

### Get a patient by id
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a patient
PUT {{gateway}}/api/patients/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace Hopper",
  "email": "grace.hopper@example.com",
  "address": "2 Navy Yard",
  "dateOfBirth": "1906-12-09"
}

### Delete a patient
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/patients/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing token -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/patients
